so plays a role in the control of chromatin structure and cell cycle progression during the transition from mitosis into interphase (PubMed:20516061)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}